        "value": "UPI x40, IMPS x45, NEFT x12, RTGS x0.2",
        "confidence": "assumed",
        "source": null,
        "detail": "Modelling choice. Laundering concentrates value into fewer, larger retail-rail transfers, and stays below RTGS's typical ticket to avoid the scrutiny that comes with it."
